      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW FABLE (2) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 1.1 lengths third (26.09) over 460m at this track. Top chance in this line up. GRAY GROUPER (1) looks close to another win after finishing second from Box 4 last time (24.55) at Bendigo. Racing well and deserves a win. SHARAPOVA STAR (7) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at Warrnambool in a handy 22.36 beating Lilly Zoom. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and a minor placing from nine starts. Hard to fault her recent form and can win again. I'M EASY (3) continues to race well and is sure to be competitive again.",
